    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mama's Sleeping Angels",
    "steam_appid": 2918310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=494 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a sleepover with your friends, you found yourself in Mama's dream! <strong><i>Mama is very hungry,</i> so it's up to you to venture out into her subconscious and find cursed objects to feed her.</strong> Be careful, though, as the curses affect you! They may induce hallucinations, spawn a new plague, or even conjure corporeal pursuers....<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=680 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But that's great news! Mama loves to eat curses\u2014the worse the curse, the more her love grows! (Along with her appetite) <strong>As long as Mama is satiated, her angels get to keep searching for\u00a0guns and masks that cause <u>permanent bodily changes</u>.</strong> Don't worry about Mama starving, though; she'll just eat you before that happens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/2df6d162fb1c950ba39b1618cc4d822f.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=494 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/2df6d162fb1c950ba39b1618cc4d822f.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/2df6d162fb1c950ba39b1618cc4d822f.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mama dreams of neighborhoods, sewers, endless foggy halls, inverted hanging superstructures, and a myriad of beings with ulterior motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/6bf31a36c9219035b53bc0e0f50f56f7.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/6bf31a36c9219035b53bc0e0f50f56f7.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/6bf31a36c9219035b53bc0e0f50f56f7.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may come to her dreams with different people over time, but if you've met some of the dream's <i>talkers</i> before, and especially if you've emotionally impacted them, they will remember you and treat you accordingly. Not all entities will offer the goodwill of friendship, so be a good judge of character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=494 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry too much about death, as friends can lend a helping hand by decapitating your corpse, allowing your spirit to roll your head back to <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>. Whether alive or dead, at <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>, you can communicate with friends out in the dream via your flip phone. Moreover, you can use your <strong>Personal Computer</strong> to guide them through areas of the dream, identify hazardous locations, and alert them when Mama starts to wake up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=494 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/e82e6b711600021f5ff9daae9697dbeb.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a sleepover with your friends, you found yourself in Mama's dream! <strong><i>Mama is very hungry,</i> so it's up to you to venture out into her subconscious and find cursed objects to feed her.</strong> Be careful, though, as the curses affect you! They may induce hallucinations, spawn a new plague, or even conjure corporeal pursuers....<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=680 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/a65e563ea131e27b2ff4b6f36a0f0376.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But that's great news! Mama loves to eat curses\u2014the worse the curse, the more her love grows! (Along with her appetite) <strong>As long as Mama is satiated, her angels get to keep searching for\u00a0guns and masks that cause <u>permanent bodily changes</u>.</strong> Don't worry about Mama starving