.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=494 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/c52bbab017c2dc5444c827343d0f9fda.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry too much about death, as friends can lend a helping hand by decapitating your corpse, allowing your spirit to roll your head back to <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>. Whether alive or dead, at <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>, you can communicate with friends out in the dream via your flip phone. Moreover, you can use your <strong>Personal Computer</strong> to guide them through areas of the dream, identify hazardous locations, and alert them when Mama starts to wake up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.poster.avif?t=1754489700\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.webm?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/78b593e62f86cb97228034856c42e9b3.mp4?t=1754489700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
